{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415673","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415673","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041567301:0":{"text":"全部で十四回！今日も完ぺきなバクハツだったでしょ？","source_cn":"今天又完成了十四次完美无缺的爆炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10CA9D8472EB5444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567302:0":{"text":"うんうん、向こうも大絶賛だったぞ！","source_cn":"很棒很棒，我已经接到那边对你的称赞了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x557FA1085FCD0768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567303:0":{"text":"ちなみに、今回の爆破ポイントはどうやって選んだんだ？","source_cn":"这次你炸点的选择是怎么想的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA87098E18043FC4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567304:0":{"text":"え？いつも通り、こう……パッと、ビビッと、直感で選んだヨ。","source_cn":"呃，就还是那样啊，就，光凭着感觉，感觉那里比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF222AEC5FAD4F997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567305:0":{"text":"いやいや、いつもは威力がデカくなる場所を選んでただろ？","source_cn":"不不不，你以前选择炸点，是会选择威力比较大的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6857EDFF3AA70DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567306:0":{"text":"たとえば、数カ所を同時に爆破して、一気に大きな穴を開けてたじゃないか。","source_cn":"比如用几个点，就可以迅速开凿出最大的空间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1309A04556ECFCBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567307:0":{"text":"でも今回は、鉱脈に一番近い所を選んだって聞いたぞ。","source_cn":"但这次选择，我接到的汇报是，你选择了最接近矿脉的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09487D1BB68F911D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567308:0":{"text":"だって、現場のオジサンが「まわりは安全で、鉱脈は深い所にある」って言ってたんだもん。","source_cn":"因为那个带头的大叔说周围很安全，但矿脉很深。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3557CF445FE57F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567309:0":{"text":"アタシは教えてもらった場所の通りにバクハしただけだよ。途中でちょっとは調整したかもだけど……","source_cn":"我是按照他提供的位置进行爆破的，但中途也不知道为什么就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80F34028F15BA868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567310:0":{"text":"うーん、分かってるけど分かってないって感じか。","source_cn":"唔，还是知其然不知其所以然啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x963141F988DD74AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567311:0":{"text":"クルル、ちゃんとした勉強をしてみる気はないか？理論を学んでみるとか……","source_cn":"库露露，你有没有考虑过念念书？去学习些理论知识——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D997D2C8B60D868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567312:0":{"text":"カタストロフにも、詩を詠んだり、頭のいいヤツはたくさんいるって聞いたぞ。","source_cn":"我可是听说了，许多恶魔也是深谙诗书的哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D65FB11E236A1C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567313:0":{"text":"ホントに？カタストロフは強いのに、勉強もするの……？","source_cn":"真的吗？厉害的恶魔也要学习吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC01B8DA0C21F583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041567314:0":{"text":"って！アタシをだまそうたってそうはいかないヨ！そんなよく分からない勉強なんてヤだからね！","source_cn":"不对！我才不会上当！我才不会学那些乱七八糟的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83DAEFBCE360376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041567315:0":{"text":"うーん、だんだん察しがよくなってきたなあ。","source_cn":"唔，越来越不好骗了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3A4B1DB38AB8B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库露露":{"text":"クルル","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}